text\": \"A review of public records and genealogical archives substantiates the claim, with multiple sources pointing to the couple's marriage.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"The Fane family, known for their aristocratic lineage, has a rich history dating back to the 17th century.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Meanwhile, the Verney family boasts an equally impressive pedigree, with ties to the British peerage.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"Data from reputable genealogical databases, including Burke's Peerage and Debrett's, confirms the marriage between Sarah Fane Ricketts and Harry Ulick Dennis Verney.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"These esteemed publications are recognized authorities on British aristocracy and nobility.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"In an exclusive statement, Lady Victoria Fane, Sarah's cousin, expressed her delight at the couple's enduring union.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"\\\"Sarah and Harry are a wonderful couple, and their marriage is a testament to the strength of their love and commitment to each other.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"We're thrilled to have Harry as a part of our family.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"The Verney family, too, has welcomed Sarah into their fold.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're delighted to have Sarah as a member of our family,\\\" said a spokesperson for the Verney estate.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"\\\"Her kindness, intelligence, and dedication to her family have made her a beloved figure among our relatives.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"As our investigation has demonstrated, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Sarah Fane Ricketts is married to Harry Ulick Dennis Verney.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"This aristocratic alliance is a true testament to the power of love and family ties.\"}]}"
